{
  "info": {
    "name": "mit-app-api（漫画翻译 App 接口）",
    "description": "本地漫画翻译服务：一页图进 → 译文图 + 结构化结果。\n\n⚠️ 已开启鉴权：先把集合变量 token 填成 app.env 里的 MIT_API_TOKEN（当前 aFm7-O4B5VD457MKVDNpDK9QFDkjIHbd），否则全部请求 401。\n\n使用前在 Variables 里确认 baseUrl，并注意关掉 Postman 的系统代理（Settings → Proxy）。\n\n「1. 翻译一页」里 image 字段需要自己选一张图；发完会自动把 page_id 存到集合变量，后面几个请求直接点即可。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8020", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "engineUrl", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8010", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "book_id", "value": "demo-book", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "page_index", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "page_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. 健康 / 能力",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "健康检查",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-API-Token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["v1", "health"] },
            "description": "engine/db/redis 三项都为 true 才算就绪。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "能力（默认配置 + 可用翻译器）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-API-Token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/capabilities", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["v1", "capabilities"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. 翻译一页（核心）",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "翻译一页（multipart）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('page_id', j.page_id);",
                  "  console.log('page_id =', j.page_id, '| blocks =', (j.blocks||[]).length, '| cached =', j.cached);",
                  "  // 页身份核对：服务器收到的图 sha1（和 ?orig=1 取回的图对得上）+ 页码回显",
                  "  console.log('orig_sha1 =', j.orig_sha1, '| book_id =', j.book_id, '| page_index =', j.page_index);",
                  "  if (!j.orig_sha1) { console.warn('响应里没有 orig_sha1 —— app-api 镜像可能还没重建'); }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-API-Token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "text" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "image", "type": "file", "src": [], "description": "必填：整页图片（png/jpg/webp）" },
                { "key": "book_id", "value": "{{book_id}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "page_index", "value": "{{page_index}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "title", "value": "ヤニねこ Vol.01", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "order_dir", "value": "rtl", "type": "text", "description": "ltr / rtl" },
                { "key": "config", "value": "", "type": "text", "description": "可选 JSON 覆盖，例：{\"translator\":{\"target_lang\":\"CHS\"}}", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "context", "value": "", "type": "text", "description": "可选 JSON：[{\"src\":\"ニャー\",\"dst\":\"喵\"}]", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "force", "value": "false", "type": "text", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "include_background", "value": "false", "type": "text", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/pages/translate", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["v1", "pages", "translate"] },
            "description": "首次约 5~30s（跑检测/OCR/翻译/抹字/嵌字），命中 L1 缓存则几十毫秒。\ncontext_used: client=你传的 / db=服务端按 book_id 取上文 / none。\n无文字的页返回 200 + blocks:[]。\n\n★ 强烈建议带上 book_id + page_index：响应会回显 book_id / page_index / orig_sha1（服务器收到的图片字节 sha1），\n这样\"传错页\"和\"结果串页\"一眼可辨；不传就落进 _adhoc_<sha1> 桶，事后无从对照页码。\n核对方法：取 ?orig=1 的原图算 sha1，与响应里的 orig_sha1 比对。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. 取结果",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "取译文图",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-API-Token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/pages/{{page_id}}/image",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "pages", "{{page_id}}", "image"]
            },
            "description": "Postman 里点 Send and Download 存成 png。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "取原图",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-API-Token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/pages/{{page_id}}/image?orig=1",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "pages", "{{page_id}}", "image"],
              "query": [{ "key": "orig", "value": "1" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "结构化结果（块级 src/dst）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-API-Token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/pages/{{page_id}}/json",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "pages", "{{page_id}}", "json"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. 重译",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "重译（可换配置/补上下文）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-Token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"translator\": { \"translator\": \"deepseek\", \"target_lang\": \"CHS\" },\n    \"render\": { \"font_size_offset\": -6 }\n  },\n  \"context\": [ { \"src\": \"ニャー\", \"dst\": \"喵\" } ]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/pages/{{page_id}}/retranslate",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "pages", "{{page_id}}", "retranslate"]
            },
            "description": "总是重跑管线（不看 L1 缓存）。字太大就把 render.font_size_offset 设负值，例如 -6/-10。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. 书与页管理",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "建/更新书",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-API-Token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"{{book_id}}\",\n  \"title\": \"ヤニねこ Vol.01\",\n  \"format\": \"epub\",\n  \"page_count\": 206,\n  \"order_dir\": \"rtl\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/books", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["v1", "books"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "书列表",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-API-Token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/books", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["v1", "books"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "某书的页列表（状态/耗时/失败原因）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-API-Token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/books/{{book_id}}/pages",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "books", "{{book_id}}", "pages"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. 引擎侧（排查用）",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "引擎一条龙（base64 图 + 结果）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "image", "type": "file", "src": [] },
                { "key": "config", "value": "{\"translator\":{\"translator\":\"deepseek\",\"target_lang\":\"CHS\"}}", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{engineUrl}}/translate/with-form/page",
              "host": ["{{engineUrl}}"],
              "path": ["translate", "with-form", "page"]
            },
            "description": "App 内部用的就是它。返回 image_b64（PNG）+ result.translations[]。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "引擎队列长度",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": { "raw": "{{engineUrl}}/queue-size", "host": ["{{engineUrl}}"], "path": ["queue-size"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "引擎网页端（浏览器打开）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{engineUrl}}/", "host": ["{{engineUrl}}"], "path": [""] }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
